                <pb facs="0852" n="828" xml:id="pg828"/>
                <p rendition="#flush">I <hi rendition="#italic">Agenda</hi></p>
                <p>The Council adopted the following agenda for this meeting: <list>
                        <label>1</label>
                        <item>Peace Conference (draft invitation and rules of procedure)</item>
                        <label>2</label>
                        <item>Reparation (final text)</item>
                        <label>3</label>
                        <item>German questions</item>
                    </list></p>
                <p rendition="#flush">II <hi rendition="#italic">Peace Conference</hi> (Draft
                    invitation and rules of procedure)</p>
                <p>An exchange of views was held on this question.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">III <hi rendition="#italic">Next Meeting of the
                    Council</hi></p>
                <p>5 p.m. the same day</p>
